{
  "answer": "**答案:2013 年。**\n\nMaharaj Kishan Bhan 在 2013 年获得 Padma Bhushan。维基百科的奖项列表写的是\"Padmabhushan for civil services - 2013\"。BioSpectrum 2013 年 1 月的文章也提到他当周获奖。\n\n第一次搜索没有直接给出年份。我是靠 Deccan Herald 那篇报道里同批获奖的人推断出 2013,再搜一次才确认的。\"civil services\"这个说法只见于维基百科的列表,没有在官方 Padma 奖网站上核对过。\n\nSources:\n- [Maharaj Kishan Bhan – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maharaj_Kishan_Bhan)\n- [Padma Bhushan Dr MK Bhan to get Genome Valley Excellence Award today – BioSpectrum Asia](https://www.biospectrumasia.com/influencers/26/4585/padma-bhushan-dr-mk-bhan-to-get-genome-valley-excellence-award-today.html)\n- [Prez gives away Padma awards – Deccan Herald](https://www.deccanherald.com/content/327429/prez-gives-away-padma-awards.html)",
